  m_Name: Seahorse
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ObjectName: Seahorse
  Facts:
  - text: "Tails & Tiny Miracles!\nSeahorses are one of the only animals where the
      male gives birth!\nThe dad carries the babies in a special pouch until they\u2019re
      ready to swim free.\nThey use their curly tails to anchor onto plants so they
      don\u2019t drift away in currents.\nWith eyes that move independently, they
      watch for food and danger at the same time\u2014like tiny underwater robots!"
